# Needs attention
!! The owner must approve $380,000 for a second crew by 2026-10-21.

A second crew starting 2026-10-26 would add about 2,200 panels a week, taking the rate to about 5,375 a week. That is enough to finish by 2026-12-04 only if no more than 2 weather days are lost.

step Owner approves $380,000 for the second crew | 2026-10-21 | Owner
step Second crew starts | 2026-10-26 | Ingrid Valdez
